47:- **Reuse a shared upstream runner.** The five files are copied from `agent-task-executor` and `go-skeleton`, not vendored from a package. A shared template is the right end state, but it is its own change across every repo in the goal's target set; copying first keeps each repo's arm independently verifiable.
